      	<a href="https://fdtc.elluciancrmrecruit.com/Apply/Account/Create?f=ccd8b99d-c58d-433a-ad62-be6d827d6d66&o=6a3c4831-f67f-4a75-96a2-7d9abe00a9de&IsInquiry=True">Request info</a>
      	<a href="/take-a-campus-tour/">Visit Us</a>
      	
    </div>
</div>
<div class="mobile-header-links">
    <a href="/apply-now/">Apply Now</a>
  	<a href="https://fdtc.elluciancrmrecruit.com/Apply/Account/Create?f=ccd8b99d-c58d-433a-ad62-be6d827d6d66&o=6a3c4831-f67f-4a75-96a2-7d9abe00a9de&IsInquiry=True">Request info</a>
</div><section class="programs-and-courses" id="programs-and-courses-44911">
    <div class="bg"></div>
    <div class="fullbleed-header-title">
        <p class="subtitle">&ldquo;Your Launchpad for Life&rdquo;</p>
        <h2 class="title">Our Programs &amp; Courses</h2>
    </div>

    <div id="featured-courses-slider" class="featured-courses-slider random" data-content-id="44911" data-num-programs="8" data-program-json="/academics/programs/program-carousel.json"></div>
    <div class="featured-courses-slider-controls featured-courses-slider-controls-44911 slick-slider-custom-controls" tabindex="0"></div>

    <div class="program-buttons row">
        <div class="small-12 large-6 columns text-center">
            <a href="/academics/" class="btn-yellow btn-icon btn-list">Find Your Pathway</a>
        </div>
        <div class="small-12 large-6 columns text-center">
            <a href="/academics/programs/" class="btn-yellow btn-icon btn-search">Program Search</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section><section id="reasons-why16491" class="reasons-why-section row">
  	<span id="d.en.16491"></span>
    <h2 class="text-center">Get Started</h2>
    <div class="text-center general-text"><p>Picking the right college to begin your career journey is a big deal! Florence-Darlington Technical College has a number of benefits that can help you make the connection between college and your future career. Whether you're pursuing a two-year degree, preparing to transfer to a four-year institution, or continuing your education to pick up some additional skills, FDTC can offer you pathways to support your career goals.</p></div>

    <div class="reasons-why-slider"><div class="reason general-text">
    <div class="reason-image" style="background-image: url('/media/fdtc/site-assets/images/student-aid-1587.jpg');">
        <div class="overlay"></div>
        <span class="number">Transfer Option</span>
    </div>
    <p>Are you interested in transferring to a 4-year university? We have paths that make this easy.<br /><strong><a href="/academics/transfer-agreements/">Learn About Transfer Paths &gt;</a></strong></p>
</div><div class="reason general-text">
    <div class="reason-image" style="background-image: url('/media/fdtc/site-assets/images/student-success-3.jpg');">
        <div class="overlay"></div>
        <span class="number">Early College</span>
    </div>
    <p>High school students get a head start on your college journey.<br /><span style="text-decoration: underline;"></span><a href="/apply-now/high-school-student/early-college-academy/"><span><strong>Learn How to Get a Head Start &gt;</strong></span></a></p>
</div><div class="reason general-text">
    <div class="reason-image" style="background-image: url('/media/fdtc/site-assets/images/Profession-2026.jpg');">
        <div class="overlay"></div>
        <span class="number">Continuing Ed</span>
    </div>
    <p>Our Corporate and Workforce Development programs can help you advance your career or help businesses create training courses.<br /><strong><a href="/corporate-workforce-development/">Learn About Career Development &gt;</a></strong></p>
</div><div class="reason general-text">
    <div class="reason-image" style="background-image: url('/media/fdtc/site-assets/images/graduation-0943.jpg');">
        <div class="overlay"></div>
        <span class="number">Online College</span>
    </div>
    <p>We offer several programs with online and hybrid options making college convenient for you.<br /><a href="/academics/online-college/"><strong>Learn More &gt;</strong></a></p>
</div>	</div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="reasons-why-slider-controls slick-slider-custom-controls " tabindex="0"></div>
    </div>
</section><span id="d.en.36674"></span>
<section class="video-slider-section bg-yellow" id="video-slider-36674">
    <div class="video-slider-content row">
        <h2>Student Success and Workforce Development is our Mission</h2>
        
        <noscript>
            Please enable JavaScript in your browser settings to use the video slider
        </noscript>
        <div class="video-controls">
            <button class="resume" data-slide="0" style="display:none">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                    <path d="m11.596 8.697-6.363 3.692c-.54.313-1.233-.066-1.233-.697V4.308c0-.63.692-1.01 1.233-.696l6.363 3.692a.802.802 0 0 1 0 1.393"/>
                </svg>
                <span>Resume</span>
            </button>
            <!--<label for="keyword123" class="sr-only">Search videos</label>
            <div class="video-search-wrapper">
                <input type="text" name="keyword" placeholder="Search" id="keyword123" class="video-search">
            </div>-->
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="video-slider"><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/KxHLV7mgo24/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Shametra Myers, FDTC Alumni Story">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/KxHLV7mgo24">
                <span>Shametra Myers, FDTC Alumni Story</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>Shametra Meyers is the Executive Director of MUSC Health Marion Medical Center. Twenty years ago, she was a student at Florence-Darlington Technical College. Shametra is an FDTC alumni success story.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/K7n8s0WZk-4/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Shaniqua Joe: FDTC Student Success Story">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/K7n8s0WZk-4">
                <span>Shaniqua Joe: FDTC Student Success Story</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>Shaniqua Joe is a veteran who came back to college after being in the workforce for more than a decade. She's getting back in the game and earning college credit to transfer to a four year degree program. Shaniqua has a plan and goals. We're happy to help her execute that plan. Shaniqua is a FDTC Student Success Story.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/4XmCVEKRUYI/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Jamie Carsten, FDTC Alumni Story">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/4XmCVEKRUYI">
                <span>Jamie Carsten, FDTC Alumni Story</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>Meet Jamie Carsten, City Executive/Vice-President at Anderson Brothers Bank in Florence. After earning his Associates Degree from FDTC in 1989 he started work as a bank teller. Today he looks back on a career that he didn&rsquo;t imagine and an amazing journey. Jamie is an FDTC alumni success story.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/Xvag0k24-h8/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Letia James, FDTC Alumni Story">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/Xvag0k24-h8">
                <span>Letia James, FDTC Alumni Story</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>After the pandemic, marketing professional Letia James decided it was time to re-skill and change career direction. She chose FDTC&rsquo;s IT program and now works for a great local company. Letia is an FDTC alumni success story.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/2SJPBxKQOok/hqdefault.jpg" alt="PDRTA and FDTC Partnership Helps Pee Dee Students">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/2SJPBxKQOok?si=jQ19T_w9N9504c1x">
                <span>PDRTA and FDTC Partnership Helps Pee Dee Students</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>We&rsquo;re proud to partner with the Pee Dee Regional Transport Authority (PDRTA) to support our students on their journey to success! PDRTA provides reliable public transit that helps FDTC students get to class and beyond. Through the Semester Pass program, students can even use financial aid for unlimited rides while in college.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/WWNWTG6KgLE/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Nastasia Guy: Student Success Story">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/WWNWTG6KgLE?si=N9ZU-QGLavfoi31i">
                <span>Nastasia Guy: Student Success Story</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>Nastasia Guy&rsquo;s journey to success is an inspiring testament to resilience and purpose. After starting in the Certified Nursing Assistant (CNA) program, Nastasia realized her true calling was in psychology. She transitioned into the Human Services program at Florence-Darlington Technical College, and despite the challenges of balancing work and school, she embraced every step of the journey. </p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/Ep5JqsVYCWM/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Graduate Success Story: Ariel Myers">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/Ep5JqsVYCWM?si=CWjUx_-gRs_M14sx">
                <span>Graduate Success Story: Ariel Myers</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>Ariel Myers received her GED 2 years ago at age 28. This Thursday night she'll walk the stage and graduate with her first degree. Coker University and a psychology degree will be her next goal.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/PGKbANvvTwQ/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Micah Yates Success Story">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/PGKbANvvTwQ?si=nLHhESFUK9MwsVYZ">
                <span>Micah Yates Success Story</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>Micah Yates has a lot of reasons to smile! He&rsquo;s getting a top-notch education at Florence-Darlington Technical College, where he is enrolled in the Dental Hygiene program. He was a starting player on the FDTC team that went to the JUCO World Series in 2021. And he&rsquo;s got big plans for making a difference in his local community after graduation.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/OnCQRXaSDDs/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Graduate Success Story: Burns Bailey">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/OnCQRXaSDDs?si=7_oXuI3QI3YfqoSZ">
                <span>Graduate Success Story: Burns Bailey</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>Burns Bailey came to FDTC after trying a few jobs in his early 20s. On May 9 he&rsquo;ll be graduating from our Machine Tool Tech Program. His professors helped him build confidence in machining; now he has a plan for a future career.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/lDBiICL7JpE/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Madison Shake: Student Success Story">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/lDBiICL7JpE?si=srPEJBn3ZekcSaxi">
                <span>Madison Shake: Student Success Story</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>Madison Shake is a high school student who is attending college at FDTC through our dual-enrollment program.  She is taking welding classes at the Lake City site within The Continuum. Madison is a FDTC student success story! </p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/85B9ePfn4cg/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Graduate Success Story: Priscilla Atkinson">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/85B9ePfn4cg?si=gEOJQpKet-aXomvV">
                <span>Graduate Success Story: Priscilla Atkinson</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>Priscilla Atkinson is a retired veteran whose dream is to have her own daycare. She&rsquo;ll be walking across the graduation stage on May 9 with a degree from our Early Care and Education Program.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/8kY7gV-aikc/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Stefanie Stewart: Student Success Story">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/8kY7gV-aikc?si=5DXoZk59ykDKAVC8">
                <span>Stefanie Stewart: Student Success Story</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>Stefanie Stewart graduated from high school and college with the class of 2023. Through Florence-Darlington Technical College&rsquo;s Early College Academy, she was able to earn both her Associate of Science and Associate of Arts degrees while attending high school. Stefanie was also the salutatorian at Darlington High School.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/gCQHRRkvIbE/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Graduate Success Story: Frank White Jr.">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/gCQHRRkvIbE?si=A2tyHVEk_2LCo8q9">
                <span>Graduate Success Story: Frank White Jr.</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>Meet Frank White Jr., former commercial truck driver, who discovered his passion in welding. Frank is one of our 808 &quot;Graduate Success Stories&quot; who will be walking across the stage on May 9, 2024 at the Florence Center.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/5rKp_xCB5Kg/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Linward C Edwards II - Alumni Spotlight">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/5rKp_xCB5Kg?si=B3gqG2gLB3sKKvLA">
                <span>Linward C Edwards II - Alumni Spotlight</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>Linward C Edwards II is an attorney in Florence and he&rsquo;s an FDTC Alumni.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="video">
    <div class="video-image"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/S5LIhvY6mDA/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Graduate Success Story: Olivia Voltolina">        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
            <path d="M16 8A8 8 0 1 1 0 8a8 8 0 0 1 16 0M6.79 5.093A.5.5 0 0 0 6 5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 0 .79.407l3.5-2.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.814z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="video-details">
        <h3>
            <a href="https://youtu.be/S5LIhvY6mDA?si=oKTV4CTW_VWXm7ad">
                <span>Graduate Success Story: Olivia Voltolina</span>
            </a>
        </h3>
        <p>FDTC Stinger Olivia Voltolina found our college through softball. Olivia juggled a full class schedule while playing softball. Her secret to success is using our online class capabilities to manage her time effectively.</p>
    </div>
</div>    </div>
    <div class="video-slider-controls slick-slider-custom-controls"></div>
</section>


